Package: com.hass.baiduspeedboost
Name: BaiduSpeedBoost
Version: 1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Local download speed-limit floor hook for Baidu Netdisk iOS 13.35.5. Keeps server-provided high values, raises only sub-floor limits. Does not touch SVIP flag (handled by existing baidudisk.dylib) or server-side speedUpToken/anti-cheat.
Maintainer: HASS
Author: HASS
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
